<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Tiger Wheels lifts year profit.</title>
<headline>Tiger Wheels lifts year profit.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     52.0	  vs 36.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 21.0	  vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   21.66	 vs 14.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   27.39	 vs 18.32</p>
<p>    Tax			 6.59	  vs 4.33</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   3.15	  vs 2.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		360.59	  vs 238.58</p>
<p>Div payable October 30</p>
<p>on register September 27</p>
<p>Full name: Tiger Wheels Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company is to offer capitalisation shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
